# Kitchen Hub: the fridge runs these with BusyBox sh, which breaks on Windows (CRLF) line endings, and the PC's
# "update from git" would then hand the fridge broken scripts. Keep LF everywhere except the Windows launchers.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
